"}, {"icon": "money", "label": "Payments", "value": "Personal and business expenses"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.86, 1.03, 1.23, 1.64, 2.24]}, {"scene": "owner", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "From 2006 to 2020, he obtained 341,455 dollars.", "t0": 13.78, "t1": 20.15, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$341,455", "label": "Housing assistance obtained"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.43, 0.85, 1.17, 1.3, 1.6, 2.55, 2.69, 3.12, 3.38, 3.66, 4.1, 4.6, 4.84, 5.08, 5.61]}, {"scene": "owner", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "He used the money for personal bills, his business and a Hawaii timeshare.", "t0": 20.27, "t1": 24.2, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "plea", "kicker": "U.S. Attorney’s Office, Northern District of California", "text": "Use of funds", "mark": "Use of funds"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.37, 0.48, 0.7, 0.89, 1.33, 1.65, 1.85, 2.3, 2.47, 2.54, 2.97]}, {"scene": "sentence", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "He pleaded guilty and received a one-year prison sentence.", "t0": 24.42, "t1": 27.41, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sentence", "kicker": "U.S. Attorney’s Office, Northern District of California", "text": "Federal sentencing", "mark": "Federal sentencing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.5, 0.92, 1.07, 1.41, 1.5, 1.87, 2.21]}, {"scene": "sentence", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The court ordered him to repay 341,455 dollars.", "t0": 27.53, "t1": 32.81, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Restitution order"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.41, 0.72, 0.87, 1.05, 1.46, 1.77, 2.18, 2.62, 3.43, 3.69, 3.98, 4.52]}, {"scene": "sentence", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The order sets what he owed. The sentencing record does not say how much was collected.", "t0": 32.93, "t1": 37.57, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Amount collected"]}, 